OL,5,G1300 Classical Live
OL,6,     FSaxophonist Jess Gillam performs
OL,7,     Flive from Wigmore Hall, and
OL,8,     FClassical Live begins a week of
OL,9,     Frecent performances from the
OL,10,     FHay-on-Wye festival, plus
OL,11,     FTchaikovsky's 5th Symphony.
OL,12,G1600 Composer of the Week: Purcell
OL,13,     F1/5. Donald Macleod explores Henry
OL,14,     FPurcell's childhood in London - at
OL,15,     Fthe time a city in turmoil - and
OL,16,     FPurcell's youth as a chorister in
OL,17,     Fthe Chapel Royal.
OL,18,G1700 In Tune
OL,19,     FKatie welcomes composer Shirley J.
OL,20,     FThompson and The London Tango
OL,21,     FQuintet to In Tune.
