OL,5,G2330 'Round Midnight
OL,6,     FThis week, London drummer,
OL,7,     Fproducer and bandleader Moses Boyd
OL,8,     Fis sitting in for Soweto Kinch,
OL,9,     Fsharing some of the exciting jazz
OL,10,     Freleases from the UK and around
OL,11,     Fthe world.
OL,12,G0030 Through the Night
OL,13,     FTabea Zimmermann performs Bartok's
OL,14,     FViola Concerto with the RTVE
OL,15,     FSymphony Orchestra and conductor
OL,16,     FChristoph Konig. Dvorak's Eighth
OL,17,     FSymphony completes the programme.
